{
  "file_id": "3527",
  "text_count": 148,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "? You're spacing\nout.",
      "_offset": 0,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "It's nothing. I was thinking about\nall the things that happened to us\nsince we came here.",
      "_offset": 22,
      "_length": 89,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Yeah, yeah, a lot of things\nhappened!",
      "_offset": 112,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "I was just supposed be at camp\nwith everyone...",
      "_offset": 150,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "And then we ran into all these\nDigimon, and we're wandering\naround in this strange world...",
      "_offset": 198,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Strange world... how rude, Jou!",
      "_offset": 290,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "I-I'm sorry! But there's also\nthose black gears that make\npeaceful Digimon go berserk...",
      "_offset": 322,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Yeah, those black gears are scary.",
      "_offset": 411,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "But we've pulled through with the\npower of evolution!",
      "_offset": 446,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "I guess all we can do is try to\nfind a way back home as soon as\npossible.",
      "_offset": 500,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "You're worrying too much! Jou,\nI'll protect you.",
      "_offset": 574,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Okay...",
      "_offset": 623,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "I-it's cold...",
      "_offset": 631,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "I'm wilting...",
      "_offset": 646,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "But the cold's not a bad thing.",
      "_offset": 661,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Ehhh?!",
      "_offset": 693,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Because if it snows, we can have a\nsnowball fight and make snow huts!",
      "_offset": 700,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "I haven't been in a snowball fight\nin a long time!",
      "_offset": 770,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "What's that?\nWhat's a \"snowball fight\"?",
      "_offset": 821,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "It's a game where you fight by\nhitting each other with snowballs.",
      "_offset": 861,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Okay, and what are snow huts?",
      "_offset": 927,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "I bet it's some kind of food!",
      "_offset": 957,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Everyone's taking it easy. But if\nthe temperature drops lower, it'll \nbe even harder to set up camp.",
      "_offset": 991,
      "_length": 100,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "And it'll be hard to get food. I'm\nthe one who has to protect\neveryone.",
      "_offset": 1092,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Because I'm the oldest...",
      "_offset": 1164,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "So what do we do now?",
      "_offset": 1193,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Let's keep going! Nothing's gonna\nhappen if we stay around here\ndoing nothing.",
      "_offset": 1215,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "What? Through these snowfields?",
      "_offset": 1294,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "We can't keep going like this!",
      "_offset": 1326,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "But there's a snowfield in front\nof us and a mountain behind us. So\nwe have to keep going somehow!",
      "_offset": 1357,
      "_length": 98,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Hold on a second. I smell\nsomething strange...",
      "_offset": 1456,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "...Could it be...",
      "_offset": 1503,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Ah! Over there!",
      "_offset": 1521,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "There's smoke that way!",
      "_offset": 1537,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "That's the smell of hot springs!",
      "_offset": 1561,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "It... it's boiling!",
      "_offset": 1594,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "So that means we can't take a\nbath...",
      "_offset": 1614,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "But it's nice and warm here!",
      "_offset": 1652,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "At least it's not cold anymore.",
      "_offset": 1681,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "How can you be so calm about this?\nWhat are we going to do about\nfood? Food and...",
      "_offset": 1713,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "There's food, look!",
      "_offset": 1796,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Why is there a refrigerator in a\nplace like this?!",
      "_offset": 1819,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Ahhh! We're in luck!",
      "_offset": 1870,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "This is ridiculous! It's absurd...",
      "_offset": 1891,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Wanna go play in the snow?",
      "_offset": 1926,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Wait! I can't leave until I find\nout what's in that fridge!",
      "_offset": 1953,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "I wonder what's in there?",
      "_offset": 2013,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "All right! Let's open it!",
      "_offset": 2039,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Eggs!",
      "_offset": 2068,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Looks like this'll be today's\ndinner!",
      "_offset": 2074,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Wait a minute! We can't go around\neating other people's food.",
      "_offset": 2112,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Wouldn't that just make us\nburglars?",
      "_offset": 2174,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "But we don't have much choice.\nWe're all starving.",
      "_offset": 2211,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "If we told the owners about the\nsituation, they'd understand.",
      "_offset": 2262,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "At any rate, it's an emergency.",
      "_offset": 2324,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Let's eaaaat!",
      "_offset": 2360,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Let's eat...",
      "_offset": 2374,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "What's wrong, Jou? Aren't you\ngoing to eat?",
      "_offset": 2387,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "I was thinking about how we\nwouldn't have to go through all\nthis if we were home.",
      "_offset": 2431,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Hey, everyone! How do you like to\neat your fried eggs?",
      "_offset": 2517,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "I eat my eggs with salt and\npepper! Is there any other way to\neat them?",
      "_offset": 2572,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "I put soy sauce on mine!",
      "_offset": 2644,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Mayonnaise.",
      "_offset": 2669,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Worcestershire sauce for me!",
      "_offset": 2681,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "I like it with a little citrus\nsauce.",
      "_offset": 2710,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "You're all weird! I eat my fried\neggs with sugar! I love putting\nfermented soybeans on it, too!",
      "_offset": 2748,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Fermented soybeans?!...",
      "_offset": 2844,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "You all put those strange things\non your eggs...?",
      "_offset": 2868,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "You should put salt and pepper on \nyour eggs! Not Worcestershire \nsauce or mayonnaise!",
      "_offset": 2918,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Jou, you're so stubborn. Always\nworrying about little things...",
      "_offset": 3005,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "What do you mean, I'm stubborn?!",
      "_offset": 3069,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "See, look! You get angry so\nquickly!",
      "_offset": 3102,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Hey, Jou! Calm down!",
      "_offset": 3139,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Be quiet! I am being calm! I'm\nalways...",
      "_offset": 3160,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "You're not acting normal today.\nAre you tired?",
      "_offset": 3201,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "I'm not tired! All of you are the\nones who aren't normal here!",
      "_offset": 3248,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "I've got myself together. I...\nI've got myself together!",
      "_offset": 3311,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Honestly, I wish Jou would ease up\na bit. He's always like this...",
      "_offset": 3368,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "We've got no choice but to go!",
      "_offset": 3435,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "No, there's got to be a safer way!",
      "_offset": 3466,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "What's going on? What are they\nfighting about?",
      "_offset": 3501,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "They're fighting over whether or\nnot we should go up that mountain \nover there, Infinity Mountain.",
      "_offset": 3548,
      "_length": 98,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "If we climb it, we'll get a good\nview of the area! If we chicken\nout, we'll just be stuck here!",
      "_offset": 3647,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "You're just charging in blindly.\nYou're going to put everyone in\ndanger!",
      "_offset": 3743,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "There are a lot of ferocious\nDigimon on that mountain.",
      "_offset": 3816,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Jou! Stop them!",
      "_offset": 3871,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Both of you! We should calm down\nand talk this over!",
      "_offset": 3887,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Then what do you think, Jou?",
      "_offset": 3940,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Who do you agree with?",
      "_offset": 3969,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "(We'll get a good view of the area\nif we go up that mountain, but\nthere are also ferocious Digimon.)",
      "_offset": 3992,
      "_length": 100,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Both of you are right",
      "_offset": 4093,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Taichi is right",
      "_offset": 4115,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Yamato is right",
      "_offset": 4131,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Geez, you're unreliable! Anyway,\nwe should go as far as we can!",
      "_offset": 4151,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "No we shouldn't!",
      "_offset": 4215,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Both of you, listen to me!",
      "_offset": 4232,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "See, look!",
      "_offset": 4259,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "I'm just trying to think about\neveryone's safety!",
      "_offset": 4270,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Give it up, Taichi.",
      "_offset": 4320,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "So what are we going to do now?!",
      "_offset": 4340,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Stop! That's enough, the three of\nyou!",
      "_offset": 4373,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "It's getting late, so we'll figure\nthis out tomorrow!",
      "_offset": 4412,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "All right, let's go to bed!",
      "_offset": 4466,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Okay. Nobody's awake...",
      "_offset": 4494,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "If I climb Infinity Mountain, I\ncan figure out what we should do.",
      "_offset": 4518,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "I... I have to keep myself\ntogether!",
      "_offset": 4584,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "You can do anything as long as you\nhave fighting spirit, right?",
      "_offset": 4621,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Taichi, we're going to end up like\nboiled octopus at this rate!",
      "_offset": 4685,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "It really is boiling. I'm\ndisappointed.",
      "_offset": 4749,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "But we shouldn't be wasting time\nin hot springs now anyway.",
      "_offset": 4789,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "You're right, but I'm still\ndisappointed.",
      "_offset": 4849,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Let's talk about camp.",
      "_offset": 4891,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Let's talk about camp.",
      "_offset": 4914,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Let's talk about camp.",
      "_offset": 4937,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Let's talk about camp.",
      "_offset": 4960,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "Jou, what would you associate with\nhot springs?",
      "_offset": 4983,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "I'd say hot spring boiled eggs!",
      "_offset": 5031,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "english": "I'd say hot spring steamed buns!",
      "_offset": 5063,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "english": "Really...? I don't really like\nsoft-boiled eggs.",
      "_offset": 5096,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "english": "Ah. Really?",
      "_offset": 5145,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "english": "I would as well!\nI would definitely say the hot\nspring souvenir steamed buns.",
      "_offset": 5157,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "english": "I wonder if Digimon also bathe in\nhot springs...",
      "_offset": 5235,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "english": "These really are what you'd call\n\"hot springs\".",
      "_offset": 5284,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "english": "I bet we could make boiled eggs!",
      "_offset": 5332,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "english": "Maybe a monkey will come to bathe!",
      "_offset": 5365,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "english": "Yeah, yeah! I love eating hot\nspring boiled eggs with sugar and\nfermented soybeans!",
      "_offset": 5400,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "english": "Ehh? That, uh, sounds good.",
      "_offset": 5484,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "english": "Eh? I'm kind of scared of monkeys,\nI wouldn't want that to happen.",
      "_offset": 5512,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "english": "Really? But they're so cute...",
      "_offset": 5579,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "english": "I wonder why it's boiling?",
      "_offset": 5610,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "english": "Jou, what do you think of when you\nhear \"hot springs\"?",
      "_offset": 5637,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "english": "I'd say the bath clothes!",
      "_offset": 5692,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "english": "I'd say the Japanese-style rooms!",
      "_offset": 5718,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "english": "I'm bad at wearing bath clothes.\nThe sash always comes off before I\nwake up in the morning.",
      "_offset": 5752,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "english": "That's because of your sleeping\nposture, not the bath clothes.",
      "_offset": 5844,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "english": "Yeah! The rooms with floor mats\nare so nice! It really makes it\nfeel like you're at a hot spring!",
      "_offset": 5907,
      "_length": 97,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "english": "I want to be in one of those now,\ntoo...",
      "_offset": 6005,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "english": "I wonder what's going on at the\nbottom of those springs?",
      "_offset": 6046,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "english": "Speaking of hot springs, I wonder\nif there's table tennis?",
      "_offset": 6103,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "english": "I've never played table tennis.",
      "_offset": 6162,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "english": "I played arcade games.",
      "_offset": 6194,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "english": "Really? It's a lot of fun.",
      "_offset": 6217,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "english": "Is that so? Then next time we go\nto a hot spring, I'll challenge\nyou to table tennis!",
      "_offset": 6244,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "english": "Sure, Any kind of challenge, I'll\ntake you on!",
      "_offset": 6330,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "english": "I don't really play arcade games\nwhether or not I'm at hot springs.",
      "_offset": 6377,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "english": "Hot spring arcade games are\ndifferent, though.",
      "_offset": 6445,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "english": "Hm, I don't know...",
      "_offset": 6492,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "english": "I want to play with you guys\nsometime. With the Digimon too,\nof course!",
      "_offset": 6512,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
